# NOTE: git does NOT support trailing comments on the same line as a pattern.
# Keep comments on their own lines, otherwise the pattern is ignored.

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- Windows ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Editors / IDE ---
**/.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- MDK build & generated files (editor recreates them as needed) ---
**/.build/
**/.base/
**/.che/
**/.typings/
**/jsconfig.json
**/IClientAPI.d.ts

# --- MDK deployment settings (machine-specific: contains ClientId, target, onboarding) ---
**/.project.json

# --- Node (if used) ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
